# pstack on this project

This repo is a Vite + React weekly task tracker on GitHub Pages. Skills live in `.cursor/skills/`. Read a skill before you follow it.

## Always

- Apply `unslop` to every reply and any prose you write.
- TypeScript edits follow `typescript-best-practices`. Apply `principle-type-system-discipline` first. Parse `localStorage` JSON at the store boundary (`principle-boundary-discipline`); do not re-validate inside components.
- Tasks, subtasks, week rollover, and the 30-day TTL live in `src/taskStore.ts`. Change the data shape there first, then the UI.
- Smallest change that solves it. Do not add a backend, UI library, or extra state layer unless the user asks.
- Prove UI in the running app (`principle-prove-it-works`). `npm run build` is not enough. Click add, complete, items, filter, and reload.
- Editorial feel over implementation convenience (`principle-experience-first`). Hairlines and type, not cards, pills, or a brand-color CTA.

## Do not load

`make-bot-ui`, `automate-me`, `setup-pstack`, and `bro` are not part of this project.
